    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Regimental Attachés",
    "summary": "As [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, pick an enemy unit up to 30\" from the Master of Ordnance model in this unit and **visible** to it, which this ability has not picked yet this phase.\n\nThe **[[BLAST]](vsdata:weapon-ability/blast)** weapons that **ASTRA MILITARUM ARTILLERY** models of yours carry get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** against that unit for the rest of that phase.",
